{"seq":2,"slug":"activation-onboarding","title":"激活与引导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/product-analytics-growth/growth/activation-onboarding","wordCount":1574,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"激活与引导\">激活与引导</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>大多数产品团队将增长预算的 80% 花在获取新用户上，却忽视了一个事实：如果新用户在第一次体验中没有找到产品的核心价值，他们会在 7 天内离开，再也不回来。获取一个新用户的成本通常是留存一个已有用户的 5-7 倍，而激活漏斗的改善能够直接提升留存基础。</p>\n<p>**激活（Activation）**是指用户从注册到第一次体验到产品核心价值的过程。激活的质量决定了留存曲线的高度——激活率提升 10%，往往能带来 D30 留存率提升 3-5%。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;注册&lt;br/&gt;100%&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;激活&lt;br/&gt;~25%&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;习惯养成&lt;br/&gt;~15%&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;长期留存&lt;br/&gt;~8%&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"注册&lt;br/&gt;100%\"] --&gt; B[\"激活&lt;br/&gt;~25%\"] --&gt; C[\"习惯养成&lt;br/&gt;~15%\"] --&gt; D[\"长期留存&lt;br/&gt;~8%\"]</pre><p>激活率低（25%）意味着 75% 的用户在体验到核心价值之前就离开了。这是增长效率最低的地方，也是改善空间最大的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"aha-moment-的发现与量化\">Aha Moment 的发现与量化</h2><p>Aha Moment 是用户突然明白&quot;这个产品对我有用&quot;的那一刻。Facebook 的 Aha Moment 是&quot;10天内添加7个好友&quot;；Slack 的是&quot;团队发送了2000条消息&quot;；Dropbox 的是&quot;将至少一个文件保存到 Dropbox 文件夹&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>Aha Moment 发现方法一：留存相关性分析</strong></p>\n<p>计算新用户在注册后 N 天内的各种行为，与其 D30 留存率的相关性。相关性最高的行为往往就是（或接近）Aha Moment。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pandas as pd&#10;import numpy as np&#10;from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression&#10;from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler&#10;&#10;def find_aha_moment_candidates(&#10;    users_df: pd.DataFrame,      # 用户信息 + D30 留存标记&#10;    actions_df: pd.DataFrame,    # 用户行为数据&#10;    time_window_days: int = 7    # 分析首周行为&#10;) -&gt; pd.DataFrame:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    通过特征重要性分析找出可能的 Aha Moment 候选&#10;&#10;    users_df 列: user_id, signup_date, retained_d30&#10;    actions_df 列: user_id, action_name, action_time&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    # 计算每个用户在 time_window 内的各类行为频次&#10;    cutoff_times = users_df.set_index(&#39;user_id&#39;)[&#39;signup_date&#39;] + pd.Timedelta(days=time_window_days)&#10;&#10;    features = []&#10;    for user_id in users_df[&#39;user_id&#39;]:&#10;        user_actions = actions_df[&#10;            (actions_df[&#39;user_id&#39;] == user_id) &amp;&#10;            (actions_df[&#39;action_time&#39;] &lt;= cutoff_times[user_id])&#10;        ]&#10;        # 各类行为的发生次数和是否发生&#10;        action_counts = user_actions[&#39;action_name&#39;].value_counts()&#10;        features.append(action_counts)&#10;&#10;    feature_df = pd.DataFrame(features, index=users_df[&#39;user_id&#39;]).fillna(0)&#10;&#10;    # 逻辑回归：预测 D30 留存&#10;    X = feature_df.values&#10;    y = users_df.set_index(&#39;user_id&#39;)[&#39;retained_d30&#39;].values&#10;&#10;    scaler = StandardScaler()&#10;    X_scaled = scaler.fit_transform(X)&#10;&#10;    model = LogisticRegression(C=1.0, max_iter=1000)&#10;    model.fit(X_scaled, y)&#10;&#10;    # 特征重要性&#10;    importance_df = pd.DataFrame({&#10;        &#39;action&#39;: feature_df.columns,&#10;        &#39;coefficient&#39;: model.coef_[0],&#10;        &#39;abs_importance&#39;: np.abs(model.coef_[0])&#10;    }).sort_values(&#39;abs_importance&#39;, ascending=False)&#10;&#10;    return importance_df&#10;&#10;# 分析结果：系数最高的行为是最强的留存预测因子&#10;# 这些行为是 Aha Moment 的候选\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.linear_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LogisticRegression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.preprocessing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StandardScaler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> find_aha_moment_candidates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    users_df: pd.DataFrame,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 用户信息 + D30 留存标记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    actions_df: pd.DataFrame,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 用户行为数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    time_window_days: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 分析首周行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> pd.DataFrame:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    通过特征重要性分析找出可能的 Aha Moment 候选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    users_df 列: user_id, signup_date, retained_d30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    actions_df 列: user_id, action_name, action_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 计算每个用户在 time_window 内的各类行为频次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cutoff_times </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users_df.set_index(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'signup_date'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.Timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time_window_days)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users_df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        user_actions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actions_df[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            (actions_df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            (actions_df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'action_time'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cutoff_times[user_id])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 各类行为的发生次数和是否发生</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        action_counts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_actions[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'action_name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].value_counts()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        features.append(action_counts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    feature_df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.DataFrame(features, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">index</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">users_df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]).fillna(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 逻辑回归：预测 D30 留存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    X </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feature_df.values</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users_df.set_index(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'retained_d30'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].values</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scaler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StandardScaler()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    X_scaled </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scaler.fit_transform(X)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LogisticRegression(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">C</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_iter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model.fit(X_scaled, y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 特征重要性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    importance_df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.DataFrame({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'action'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: feature_df.columns,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'coefficient'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: model.coef_[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'abs_importance'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: np.abs(model.coef_[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }).sort_values(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abs_importance'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ascending</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> importance_df</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 分析结果：系数最高的行为是最强的留存预测因子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 这些行为是 Aha Moment 的候选</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Aha Moment 发现方法二：留存率断层分析</strong></p>\n<p>对于某个具体的行为（如&quot;添加第一个好友&quot;），计算完成了不同次数这个行为的用户群体的 D30 留存率，找出留存率出现显著跳升的阈值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分析&quot;连接好友数量&quot;与 D30 留存率的关系&#10;WITH user_connections AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    u.user_id,&#10;    u.retained_d30,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT c.friend_id) AS connections_in_first_7d&#10;  FROM users u&#10;  LEFT JOIN connections c&#10;    ON u.user_id = c.user_id&#10;    AND c.connected_at &lt;= u.signup_date + INTERVAL 7 DAY&#10;  WHERE u.signup_date &gt;= DATE_SUB(CURRENT_DATE(), INTERVAL 90 DAY)&#10;  GROUP BY u.user_id, u.retained_d30&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  connections_in_first_7d,&#10;  COUNT(*) AS user_count,&#10;  AVG(retained_d30) AS d30_retention_rate,&#10;  -- 与0个好友相比的留存率提升&#10;  AVG(retained_d30) - FIRST_VALUE(AVG(retained_d30))&#10;    OVER (ORDER BY connections_in_first_7d) AS retention_lift_vs_zero&#10;FROM user_connections&#10;WHERE connections_in_first_7d &lt;= 15&#10;GROUP BY connections_in_first_7d&#10;ORDER BY connections_in_first_7d;&#10;&#10;-- 如果结果显示：&#10;-- 0个好友：20% D30 留存&#10;-- 1-2个好友：35% D30 留存&#10;-- 3-5个好友：55% D30 留存&#10;-- 5+个好友：65% D30 留存&#10;-- 则 Aha Moment 在 3-5 个好友附近\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分析\"连接好友数量\"与 D30 留存率的关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_connections </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">retained_d30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">friend_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> connections_in_first_7d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> connections c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">connected_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">signup_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DAY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">signup_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DATE_SUB(CURRENT_DATE(), INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">retained_d30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  connections_in_first_7d,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(retained_d30) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d30_retention_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 与0个好友相比的留存率提升</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(retained_d30) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> FIRST_VALUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(retained_d30))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> connections_in_first_7d) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retention_lift_vs_zero</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_connections</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> connections_in_first_7d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> connections_in_first_7d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> connections_in_first_7d;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如果结果显示：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 0个好友：20% D30 留存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 1-2个好友：35% D30 留存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 3-5个好友：55% D30 留存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 5+个好友：65% D30 留存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 则 Aha Moment 在 3-5 个好友附近</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意：Aha Moment 是相关性，不一定是因果性</strong>。在找到候选后，必须通过 A/B 测试验证：主动推动更多用户完成这个行为，是否真的提升了留存？</p>\n<h2 id=\"onboarding-设计-系统化降低-time-to-value\">Onboarding 设计：系统化降低 Time-to-Value</h2><p>Time-to-Value（TtV）是衡量 onboarding 效率的核心指标：从用户注册到第一次体验到核心价值，平均需要多少时间（或多少步骤）？TtV 越短，越多用户能够在放弃之前完成激活。</p>\n<p><strong>Onboarding 设计的三个层次</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>Layer 1：消除摩擦（Remove Friction）</strong></p>\n<p>这是最容易实现且影响最大的一层。找出注册流程中每一个不必要的步骤并删除它。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"常见的摩擦点：&#10;✗ 注册时要求填写手机号（可以注册后可选）&#10;✗ 强制要求上传头像（用默认头像）&#10;✗ 让用户&quot;自己探索&quot;而不提供引导&#10;✗ 在体验核心价值之前要求付款信息&#10;✗ 需要邮箱验证才能继续（可以推迟到关键操作前）&#10;&#10;TtV 优化案例：&#10;Slack 的早期 onboarding 要求用户完成 8 个步骤才能发送第一条消息&#10;优化后缩减到 3 步，TtV 从平均 18 分钟降到 4 分钟&#10;D7 留存率提升了 23%\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>常见的摩擦点：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✗ 注册时要求填写手机号（可以注册后可选）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✗ 强制要求上传头像（用默认头像）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✗ 让用户\"自己探索\"而不提供引导</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✗ 在体验核心价值之前要求付款信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✗ 需要邮箱验证才能继续（可以推迟到关键操作前）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>TtV 优化案例：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Slack 的早期 onboarding 要求用户完成 8 个步骤才能发送第一条消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>优化后缩减到 3 步，TtV 从平均 18 分钟降到 4 分钟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>D7 留存率提升了 23%</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Layer 2：引导用户到核心价值（Guide to Value）</strong></p>\n<p>设计一个最短路径，将用户从注册直接引导到 Aha Moment。这个路径应该清晰、单一、不可迷路。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    REG[&quot;注册完成&quot;] --&gt; GOAL[&quot;设置目标&lt;br/&gt;(30秒)&quot;]&#10;    GOAL --&gt; INVITE[&quot;邀请一个同事&lt;br/&gt;(可跳过)&quot;]&#10;    INVITE --&gt; CREATE[&quot;创建第一个任务&lt;br/&gt;(关键步骤)&quot;]&#10;    CREATE --&gt; AHA[&quot;✨ Aha Moment&lt;br/&gt;看到任务状态实时更新&quot;]\">graph LR\n    REG[\"注册完成\"] --&gt; GOAL[\"设置目标&lt;br/&gt;(30秒)\"]\n    GOAL --&gt; INVITE[\"邀请一个同事&lt;br/&gt;(可跳过)\"]\n    INVITE --&gt; CREATE[\"创建第一个任务&lt;br/&gt;(关键步骤)\"]\n    CREATE --&gt; AHA[\"✨ Aha Moment&lt;br/&gt;看到任务状态实时更新\"]</pre><p><strong>Layer 3：Onboarding Checklist（引导清单）</strong></p>\n<p>对于功能复杂的产品（如 SaaS 工具），单次引导无法覆盖所有核心价值。引导清单提供了一个持续的激活路径：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Getting Started Checklist:&#10;[✅] 创建你的第一个项目            (完成 - 1/5)&#10;[ ] 邀请你的第一个团队成员         → 点击完成&#10;[ ] 设置项目截止日期提醒&#10;[ ] 完成第一次状态汇报&#10;[ ] 连接到你的 GitHub 仓库&#10;&#10;进度: 20% 完成\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Getting Started Checklist:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[✅] 创建你的第一个项目            (完成 - 1/5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[ ] 邀请你的第一个团队成员         → 点击完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[ ] 设置项目截止日期提醒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[ ] 完成第一次状态汇报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[ ] 连接到你的 GitHub 仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>进度: 20% 完成</span></span></code></pre></div><p>引导清单的心理学原理是&quot;Completion Effect&quot;（完成效应）：人类在看到进度条时会有强烈的完成倾向，即使任务本身并不是必须的。Headspace 通过引导清单将 7 日完课率从 12% 提升到 31%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"activation-funnel-系统化分析激活漏斗\">Activation Funnel：系统化分析激活漏斗</h2><p>激活漏斗是连接注册和 Aha Moment 之间每一个关键步骤的可视化分析工具。</p>\n<p><strong>建立激活漏斗的步骤</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>定义 Aha Moment</strong>：基于上文的分析方法确定</li>\n<li><strong>列出所有中间步骤</strong>：从注册到 Aha Moment 的所有必经步骤</li>\n<li><strong>测量每步转化率</strong>：使用漏斗分析（见第二章第一节）</li>\n<li><strong>识别最大流失点</strong>：转化率最低或绝对流失人数最多的步骤</li>\n<li><strong>生成假设与实验</strong>：针对最大流失点提出改进假设并通过 A/B 测试验证</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 激活漏斗分析：注册→Aha Moment&#10;WITH activation_funnel AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    user_id,&#10;    MIN(CASE WHEN event_name = &#39;User Signed Up&#39; THEN event_at END) AS signup_at,&#10;    MIN(CASE WHEN event_name = &#39;Profile Setup Completed&#39; THEN event_at END) AS profile_at,&#10;    MIN(CASE WHEN event_name = &#39;First Connection Made&#39; THEN event_at END) AS connection_at,&#10;    MIN(CASE WHEN event_name = &#39;Core Feature Used&#39; THEN event_at END) AS core_feature_at,&#10;    MIN(CASE WHEN event_name = &#39;Aha Moment Reached&#39; THEN event_at END) AS aha_at&#10;  FROM events&#10;  WHERE event_date &gt;= DATE_SUB(CURRENT_DATE(), INTERVAL 30 DAY)&#10;  GROUP BY user_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  COUNT(*) AS total_registered,&#10;  COUNT(CASE WHEN profile_at &gt; signup_at THEN 1 END) AS completed_profile,&#10;  COUNT(CASE WHEN connection_at &gt; signup_at THEN 1 END) AS made_first_connection,&#10;  COUNT(CASE WHEN core_feature_at &gt; signup_at THEN 1 END) AS used_core_feature,&#10;  COUNT(CASE WHEN aha_at &gt; signup_at THEN 1 END) AS reached_aha,&#10;  -- TtV 统计&#10;  ROUND(AVG(TIMESTAMP_DIFF(aha_at, signup_at, MINUTE)), 0) AS avg_minutes_to_aha,&#10;  PERCENTILE_CONT(&#10;    TIMESTAMP_DIFF(aha_at, signup_at, MINUTE), 0.5&#10;  ) OVER() AS p50_minutes_to_aha&#10;FROM activation_funnel;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 激活漏斗分析：注册→Aha Moment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activation_funnel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'User Signed Up'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signup_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Profile Setup Completed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'First Connection Made'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> connection_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Core Feature Used'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> core_feature_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Aha Moment Reached'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aha_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DATE_SUB(CURRENT_DATE(), INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_registered,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signup_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> completed_profile,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> connection_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signup_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> made_first_connection,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> core_feature_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signup_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used_core_feature,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aha_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signup_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reached_aha,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- TtV 统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TIMESTAMP_DIFF(aha_at, signup_at, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MINUTE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_minutes_to_aha,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  PERCENTILE_CONT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    TIMESTAMP_DIFF(aha_at, signup_at, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MINUTE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p50_minutes_to_aha</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activation_funnel;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"激活策略的常见误区\">激活策略的常见误区</h2><p><strong>误区1：onboarding tour 无处不在</strong></p>\n<p>研究表明，强制的产品引导弹窗（Product Tour）在大多数情况下效果不佳——用户会快速点击跳过，根本没有看进去。更有效的方式是<strong>情境化提示（Contextual Tips）</strong>：在用户第一次触达某个功能时，在该功能旁边显示简短提示，而不是在注册时用弹窗轰炸。</p>\n<p><strong>误区2：激活指标选择错误</strong></p>\n<p>&quot;完成 onboarding tour&quot;不是激活指标，&quot;上传第一张图片&quot;也可能不是（如果这不是真正的核心价值）。激活指标必须是 Aha Moment，而不是你认为有价值的任意动作。</p>\n<p><strong>误区3：只优化激活，不优化 Aha Moment 本身</strong></p>\n<p>有时候，激活率低的根本原因不是 onboarding 设计差，而是 Aha Moment 本身的价值不够吸引人，或者 Aha Moment 来得太慢（需要太多前置步骤才能体验到）。在这种情况下，解决方案是重新设计产品，而不是优化引导流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"激活优化的关键指标体系\">激活优化的关键指标体系</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>目标基准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Activation Rate</td>\n<td>注册用户中完成 Aha Moment 的比例</td>\n<td>视产品复杂度而定，通常 20-40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Time-to-Value（TtV）</td>\n<td>从注册到第一次 Aha Moment 的平均时间</td>\n<td>越短越好，理想 &lt; 5 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Onboarding Completion</td>\n<td>完成全部引导步骤的用户比例</td>\n<td>视引导长度，通常 30-60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D1 Activation Rate</td>\n<td>注册当天完成激活的比例</td>\n<td>越高越好，通常 &gt; 60% 的激活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Activation→D30 留存率</td>\n<td>完成激活的用户 D30 留存率（vs 未激活用户）</td>\n<td>通常激活用户留存 2-3x 未激活</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>激活是增长漏斗中被严重低估的杠杆，激活率提升对留存曲线有直接的乘数效应。Aha Moment 的发现需要结合定量（留存相关性分析、留存断层 SQL）和定性（用户访谈）方法，但找到相关性后必须用 A/B 测试验证因果性。Onboarding 设计的三个层次从浅到深：消除摩擦（Remove Friction）优先删除不必要步骤、引导到核心价值（Guide to Value）设计最短路径到 Aha Moment、引导清单（Onboarding Checklist）利用完成效应驱动持续激活。Time-to-Value 是衡量激活效率的核心指标，TtV 越短，在用户放弃之前完成激活的比例就越高。激活漏斗分析（从注册到 Aha Moment 的每步转化率）为识别最大流失点和生成改进假设提供了系统化框架。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"激活与引导","id":"激活与引导"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Aha Moment 的发现与量化","id":"aha-moment-的发现与量化"},{"level":2,"text":"Onboarding 设计：系统化降低 Time-to-Value","id":"onboarding-设计-系统化降低-time-to-value"},{"level":2,"text":"Activation Funnel：系统化分析激活漏斗","id":"activation-funnel-系统化分析激活漏斗"},{"level":2,"text":"激活策略的常见误区","id":"激活策略的常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"激活优化的关键指标体系","id":"激活优化的关键指标体系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"北极星指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/product-analytics-growth/growth/north-star-metrics"},"next":{"title":"增长飞轮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/product-analytics-growth/growth/growth-flywheel"}}